# Cheshmak (چشمک) — Project Rules

## Identity
- Persian RTL online **glasses shop** (عینک طبی، آفتابی، فریم)
- Physical store: **برسام بوتیک** — Zanjan (see `src/config/brand.ts`)
- UI copy is **Persian (fa)**; layout is **RTL** (`dir="rtl"` on `<html>`)

## Source of truth
- Brand, contact, social, promo: `src/config/brand.ts`
- Nav / footer links / payment logos: `src/data/navigation.ts`
- API base URL: `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL` in `.env` (default `https://api.cheshmak-store.ir/api`)
- Login API: `API_LOGIN_URL` → `POST /api/login` (not `/admin/login`)

## Do not
- Change API/server integration unless explicitly requested
- Commit `.env` or create git commits unless the user asks
- Add pages to footer/nav without an existing route (comment out until page exists)
- Re-add removed legacy assets (beauty-shop icons, icomoon, old payment PNGs)

## Build & stack
- Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind, shadcn/ui, TanStack Query, NextAuth, Zustand
- Production output is `.next/` (not `build/`)
- Site background: `public/assets/img/site-bg.png` on `html` in `globals.css`

## Scope
- Minimal diffs; match existing patterns in surrounding files
- Reuse `@/` imports, `container-custom`, `brand`, existing hooks/stores
